  "title": {
    "rendered": "سورة الشمس مكتوبة بخط كبير: 15 آية مع الترجمة الإنجليزية"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">نقدم سورة الشمس مكتوبة بخط كبير، وعدد آياتها 15، مع تلاوة صوتية آية بآية.</p>\n\n\n<div style=\"background-color: #EAEAEA; padding: 15px; text-align: center;\">\n    <h2 style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic', Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0;\">بِسْمِ اللَّهِ الرَّحْمَٰنِ الرَّحِيمِ</h2>\n</div>\n\n\n<p><script type=\"text/javascript\">\n  function changesoundy(ID) {\n    var sound_id = document.getElementById(\"quran_player_by_sora\");\n    sound_id.innerHTML = '<div style=\"margin-top:15px;\"><audio controls autoplay><source src=\"'+ID+'\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">متصفحك لا يدعم عنصر الصوت</audio><br /><a href=\"'+ID+'\">تنزيل الملف</a></div>';\n  }\n</script><h2 class=\"sora_title\">سورة الشمس</h2><div id=\"quran_player_by_sora\"></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091001.mp3');\">وَالشَّمْسِ وَضُحَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [1]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091002.mp3');\">وَالْقَمَرِ إِذَا تَلَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [2]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091003.mp3');\">وَالنَّهَارِ إِذَا جَلَّاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [3]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091004.mp3');\">وَاللَّيْلِ إِذَا يَغْشَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [4]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091005.mp3');\">وَالسَّمَاءِ وَمَا بَنَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [5]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091006.mp3');\">وَالْأَرْضِ وَمَا طَحَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [6]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091007.mp3');\">وَنَفْسٍ وَمَا سَوَّاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [7]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091008.mp3');\">فَأَلْهَمَهَا فُجُورَهَا وَتَقْوَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [8]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091009.mp3');\">قَدْ أَفْلَحَ مَن زَكَّاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [9]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091010.mp3');\">وَقَدْ خَابَ مَن دَسَّاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [10]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091011.mp3');\">كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ بِطَغْوَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [11]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091012.mp3');\">إِذِ انبَعَثَ أَشْقَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [12]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091013.mp3');\">فَقَالَ لَهُمْ رَسُولُ اللَّهِ نَاقَةَ اللَّهِ وَسُقْيَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [13]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091014.mp3');\">فَكَذَّبُوهُ فَعَقَرُوهَا فَدَمْدَمَ عَلَيْهِمْ رَبُّهُم بِذَنبِهِمْ فَسَوَّاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [14]</span></div></div><div class=\"quran_gateway_by_sora\"><div class=\"aya_ar_by_sora\" onclick=\"changesoundy('https://www.qurantranslations.net/sound/versebyversequran/Arabic_Alafasy/091015.mp3');\">وَلَا يَخَافُ عُقْبَاهَا <span class=\"sora_name_by_sora\">الشمس [15]</span></div></div></p>\n",
